  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of the IRIS: Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The focus of this project is to deepen engagement with key industry groups and multi-stakeholder initiatives, leverage well-established relationships with brands, employers and recruiters, and strengthen migrant-centred models of supply chain due diligence. This work aims to generate stronger and direct demand for ethical recruitment.</narrative>
  </description>
